abstract: "Code, derived data and a publication-hold-out benchmark for auditing how evaluation protocol limits the learnability of paralog/isoform selectivity across 51 curated and 60 random ChEMBL 37 target pairs: variance decomposition, scaffold-split leakage, cross-publication noise ceiling, leave-publication-out evaluation and empirical-Bayes few-shot anchor calibration."
